[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21787.91, "timestamp": "06:03:07", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21798.628, "timestamp": "06:03:18", "text": "知道。你知道，如果我能做到的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21806.15, "timestamp": "06:03:26", "text": "兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21812.47, "timestamp": "06:03:32", "text": "不，我摔倒了。我的天啊。别告诉我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21814.39, "timestamp": "06:03:34", "text": "我的天啊。现在我不得不谈到这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21822.23, "timestamp": "06:03:42", "text": "所以，呃，各位，帮帮忙。呃，我该怎么办？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21825.67, "timestamp": "06:03:45", "text": "当我像这样的时候，比如摇晃我的背"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21828.548, "timestamp": "06:03:48", "text": "像这样吗？给你留点空间。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21830.948, "timestamp": "06:03:50", "text": "然后试着，呃，去做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21834.39, "timestamp": "06:03:54", "text": "就像“等等，等等，我来了”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21837.51, "timestamp": "06:03:57", "text": "好吧，放开鼠标，然后我就会摔倒。"}]